# Line endings are normalised here rather than left to each clone's core.autocrlf.
#
# Generated artifacts (map.yaml, EXPERIMENTS.md, every meta.yaml) are byte-compared by
# CI: it regenerates them and fails if anything differs. Without this file the result
# depends on which platform last ran the generators — Windows writes CRLF, Linux LF —
# so the gate would flip red for a reason that has nothing to do with content.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ipynb binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
